/ An agenda item about something else that names the Drucksache: where and
/ under which item, with the passage that names it where the minutes do.
.py-2.border-top
  .small.text-secondary
    => l item.meeting.date
    ' ·
    => item.meeting.committee&.name || item.meeting.title
    ' ·
    = "TOP #{item.number}"
  = link_to strip_tags(item.title), minutes_meeting_path(item.meeting, anchor: item.id)
  - if (passage = mention_excerpt(item, document))
    p.small.mb-0.mt-1= passage
